      "comment": "BROOKLYN BRAWL (1) finished second (22.01) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Form here at the trip sound including five wins. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Can make amends. BANJO'S CLANCY (2) goes very well here starting nine times for three wins and three minors. Below best last time at this track (22.52) in a Grade 5, finishing a 8 length sixth. Among the main chances. REIN ME IN (7) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in three starts, including two wins. Was out of the placings last time (26.22) at this track in a Restricted WIN, finishing eighth and beaten 12 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. BRIGHT SIDE (8) is worth some thought after placing at this track and distance last start.",
